WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:07.049
I wrote something for one of my
daughters and at this point one of my

00:00:07.049 --> 00:00:13.380
daughter's was quite frankly not
treating my wife with the kind of

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:18.869
respect that my wife deserves you know
it was typical teenager stuff I roll the

00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:26.250
eyes a flippin comment basically young
adolescent girl with young adolescent

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.840
attitude what you talked about earlier
no no one can tell me anything I know

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:40.170
everything and in her mind you know my
wife was just some lady that did the

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:45.410
laundry got the groceries and cooked
dinner and that's how she treated her

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:56.610
and so I wrote this for my daughter but
I wanted to read it for everyone you

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:06.240
know and I want to dedicate it not just
to my wife but to all the military wives

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:16.020
out there holding the line on the home
front so this is what I wrote to my

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:18.320
daughter

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:27.689
your mom I wanted you to know a little
bit about your mom your mom was a

00:01:27.689 --> 00:01:32.909
champion horse rider
she rode cross-country races showjumping

00:01:32.909 --> 00:01:37.860
and she did fox hunting she cared for
her horses every day

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:46.470
clean them train them and took care of
them she won many victories your mom

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:51.090
worked since she was little
starting in restaurants first peeling

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:58.189
potatoes than busing tables than
cleaning than waitressing to make money

00:01:58.189 --> 00:02:03.530
your mom went to an extremely good
college her parents didn't pay for it

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:10.830
she worked through college as a waitress
to pay your own way when your mom got

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.680
done with college she took the money she
saved

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:21.510
and backpacked around the world she went
to Thailand Malaysia Hawaii Australia

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:28.650
New Zealand and a bunch of other places
while doing that she worked as a

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:38.579
waitress another odd job so she could
make money and pay her own way when your

00:02:38.579 --> 00:02:43.680
mom got done traveling the economy was
bad and she couldn't find a job so she

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:52.709
went overseas and worked at an airline
as a flight attendant which is a hard

00:02:52.709 --> 00:02:59.099
thankless job serving ungrateful
passengers on planes she didn't like it

00:02:59.099 --> 00:03:07.290
but she did it when I met your mom for
the first time she was the most

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:14.280
beautiful girl I had ever seen and when
I talked to her she was the nicest

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:22.560
person I have ever met and she was funny
and sassy and sweet and I knew

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.389
immediately that I wanted to marry her

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:31.579
so your mom picked up everything and
left and came to be with me in America

00:03:31.579 --> 00:03:37.500
she moved into a tiny one-bedroom
apartment with me she was wonderful she

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:41.819
was adventurous she surfed with me and
she trained jiu-jitsu with me every day

00:03:41.819 --> 00:03:47.400
and worked out with me every day she got
her blue belt in jujitsu she worked as

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:53.430
an executive assistant in a real estate
office and got a real estate license we

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:57.690
went skiing and hiked mountains and
camped under the stars in the mountain

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:07.500
and we went dancing at night she was
amazing I got orders to move to Virginia

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.370
she instantly packed up everything we
had and quit her job and moved across

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:18.180
country when we got to Virginia she got
a tough job working for an insurance

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:23.639
company of course I was in a seal
platoon so I traveled all the time and

00:04:23.639 --> 00:04:28.340
was gone all the time and she never
complained

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:33.620
one day she told me she was pregnant
that was you

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:42.629
she was so happy and then the day after
you were born I left on deployment for

00:04:42.629 --> 00:04:45.300
seven months she did everything by
herself

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:52.680
I was gone she never complained and she
sent me a picture every day of you when

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.099
I got home from deployment
she was already back in shape and looked

00:04:56.099 --> 00:05:03.300
amazing the Navy gave me orders back to
California without a word your mom

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:07.759
packed away all of our stuff quit her
job and we moved back to California I

00:05:07.759 --> 00:05:13.080
worked and went to school I never got up
in the night to help take care of you it

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:18.810
was always your mom every time she
changed every diaper made every meal

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:25.860
tried every tear read every goodnight
book I worked went to school and trained

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:32.250
jiu-jitsu she never complained one
single time soon she told me she was

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:36.870
pregnant again that was your first
sister when your first sister came now

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:41.610
everything that your mom did for you she
had to do for your sister too every

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:48.300
diaper every meal every tear every
little book read I was working and going

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:55.409
to school and training she walked you
both and read to you and took you to

00:05:55.409 --> 00:05:58.740
parks and play groups and dancing
lessons and swimming lessons and craft

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:05.099
fairs she did everything for you she
didn't get to surf anymore or do jujitsu

00:06:05.099 --> 00:06:10.139
anymore or workout or hike with me
anymore she devoted all that time to you

00:06:10.139 --> 00:06:18.180
her kids who she cherished she never
complained or whined or asked for

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:28.169
anything then she got pregnant again
this time it was your brother she kept

00:06:28.169 --> 00:06:33.539
doing everything for you when she got
her morning sickness throwing up dizzy

00:06:33.539 --> 00:06:39.959
and carrying around a baby in her belly
she didn't complain ever when she was in

00:06:39.959 --> 00:06:43.080
the bath
SiC and throwing up she would apologize

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:49.400
to you and you said you and your sister
that you girls had to see her like that

00:06:51.560 --> 00:07:00.840
then the war started I went back to the
SEAL Teams I went to Iraq for six months

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:07.670
I was working so much that I barely got
time to write your mom always wrote me

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:13.110
she never complained about anything she
did everything by herself everything I

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:17.160
was taking care of my seal platoon and
she took care of you three little kids

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:22.410
she cleaned everything made every meal
changed every diaper dried every tear

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:26.940
took you to lessons and parks and
doctors appointments and read to you

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:33.830
every night and major lunches and got
groceries she did this all by herself

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:44.040
no in-laws to help out no grandparents
around just her alone when I came home

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:48.419
things didn't get any better I just
started getting ready to go back to Iraq

00:07:48.419 --> 00:07:55.140
again she didn't complain some guys had
to worry about their families their

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:59.040
wives would complain and cry and filed
for divorce and fight over the kids I

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:04.919
never worried about that at all
your mom took care of everything and

00:08:04.919 --> 00:08:13.800
never made me have to worry about you
kids or her or anything else my last

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:19.020
deployment to Iraq I was gone almost
seven months I left your mom alone again

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:29.040
with you three kids some of my men were
wounded and killed your mom went to the

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:36.750
hospital to visit the wounded men and
went to the funerals of my friends your

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:44.610
mom knew at any time it could be me that
was wounded or killed but she never

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:49.510
complained she cried with the moms of my
friends

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:55.120
she gave support where she could but she
never asked me to stop or come home or

00:08:55.120 --> 00:09:07.529
leave early or even be safe never she
never asked me to give anything to her

00:09:07.529 --> 00:09:14.980
she knew I had men to take care of she
told me not to worry about her or all

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:20.920
you kids she only told me to do my best
at my job and take care of my friends on

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:33.220
the battlefield most seals get divorced
almost 90% there is too much pressure

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:38.589
and separation and distance and too many
challenges and many women can't take it

00:09:38.589 --> 00:09:48.970
so they leave your mom never wavered she
never had an issue or a complaint no

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:55.720
matter what happened or when I came home
or when I left or what I did she

00:09:55.720 --> 00:10:00.760
supported me always and she took care of
you kids every day every night every

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:10.420
moment every need you had was her
responsibility she never asked for

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:15.339
thanks or appreciation and when it was
her birthday or our anniversary she

00:10:15.339 --> 00:10:25.540
would tell me not to get her anything
so we could save money when I got home

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:30.040
from my last deployment to Iraq
your mom got pregnant again that was

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:35.680
your youngest sister and she did it all
again morning sickness diapers sleepless

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:42.130
nights puke in the bed pee on the floor
chickenpox lice tears scrapes bumps

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:51.130
bruises teacher conferences school
lunches everything she never complained

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:57.910
about it I was still working
preparing men for war and traveling all

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:03.930
the time and she continued to take care
of you kids so I could do my job

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:12.560
your mom is stuck with me through hell
it has been hard

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:18.230
your mom has been married to this
hard-headed frogman for 17 years she's

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:22.100
been through multiple wartime
deployments she has helped me when I was

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:29.089
sick or injured and she has done the
same for you she has done it because she

00:11:29.089 --> 00:11:33.470
is strong and determined and she loves
our family more than anything in the

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:43.370
world your mom is an incredible person
an amazing woman and I worship her she

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:46.839
is everything I ever wanted

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:57.589
so when you get the chance you should
tell your mom that you love her that you

00:11:57.589 --> 00:12:02.029
know how much she has done for you and
for our family and that you appreciate

00:12:02.029 --> 00:12:14.360
everything that she has done for us and
for you I hope you grow up and have some

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:23.470
of the same qualities that she possesses
strength honor intelligence dignity

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:36.740
selflessness respect determination and
kindness that's your mom and I hope you

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:44.969
realize how blessed you are ever

00:12:50.750 --> 00:13:01.279
and that's the note that I wrote to my
daughter and you know there's some

00:13:01.279 --> 00:13:13.250
people that say a woman can do anything
that a man can do then I don't know if

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:21.350
that's true or not but I can tell you
this I don't know of too many men that

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:26.689
can do what my wife has done and what
thousands of other military wives have

00:13:26.689 --> 00:13:28.899
done

